flowchart LR
  A[User connects repository] --> B[POST /workspaces/:id/repositories]
  B --> C[RepositoriesService.createRepository]
  C --> D[Repository status: PENDING]
  C --> E[Enqueue BullMQ job: reindex]

  E --> F[Worker: processReindex]
  F --> G[Create IndexingRun RUNNING]
  F --> H[Set status: CLONING]
  F --> I[Delete previous artifacts + vectors]
  F --> J[Enqueue clone]

  J --> K[Worker: processClone]
  K --> L[git clone --depth 1]
  L --> M[Set status: PARSING]
  M --> N[Enqueue parse]

  N --> O[Worker: processParse]
  O --> P[Walk files + extract symbols]
  P --> Q[Set status: CHUNKING]
  Q --> R[Enqueue chunk]

  R --> S[Worker: processChunk]
  S --> T[Create chunks]
  T --> U[Set status: EMBEDDING]
  U --> V[Enqueue embed]

  V --> W[Worker: processEmbed]
  W --> X[Generate embeddings]
  X --> Y[Upsert vectors Qdrant]
  Y --> Z[Set IndexingRun SUCCEEDED]
  Z --> AA[Set repository READY + lastIndexedAt]

  classDef fail fill:#ffe5e5,stroke:#cc0000,stroke-width:1px;
  AB[On any stage failure]:::fail --> AC[mark IndexingRun FAILED]:::fail
  AC --> AD[Set repository FAILED + indexingError]:::fail
